will inundate the world with the rasa of Kṛṣṇa’s Name by performing grand saṅkīrtan."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["nartana-vilāsa    mṛdaṅga-vādana","    śuniba āpana-kāṇe","dekhiyā dekhiyā    se līlā-mādhurī","    bhāsiba premera vāne"],"translation":["I will hear the sounds of the mṛdaṅgas and the play of Their dancing with my own ears. Beholding the beauty of this līlā, I will float in a flood of prema."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["nā dekhi’ ābāra    se līlā-ratana","    kā̐di ‘hā gaurāṅga!’ bali’","āmāre viṣayī    ‘pāgala’ baliyā","    aṅgete dibeka dhūli"],"translation":["Again, not seeing those jewel-like Pastimes before me, I cry, calling out, “O Gaurāṅga!” Considering me mad, the worldly will kick dust on my body."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/45-gurudeva-kabe-tava-karuna","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en/gurudeva-kabe-tava-karuna-prakashie/","description":"Gurudeva! Kabe Tava Karuṇā-prakāśe — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Gurudeva! Kabe Tava Karuṇā-prakāśe. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"gurudeva-kabe-tava-karuna-prakashie"}}